   "Public administration AI systems should be publicly approved before use and monitored across their life cycle.",
   "Good administration requires transparency of data origin and processing, and justified decisions.",
   "Public administration as a 'glass house' is incompatible with black-box AI.",
   "Judicial control of AI-supported administrative activity is needed.",
   "State liability for damage caused by public AI systems has particular features."
